{
  "id": "chapter4",
  "title": "第四回·暗流试锋·西北征途",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "ch4_s1_platform",
      "bgLabel": "scene4_train_station",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ch4s1_open",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "【1937年12月下旬·长沙火车站】\n成功报名加入服务团并接受了一个星期的讲习后，你跟随服务团从长沙乘火车去武昌。\n\n站台上人头攒动，有送别的亲人，有整装待发的士兵，有扛着器材的服务团成员。远处传来火车的汽笛声。在服务团集合点，团员们三三两两聚在一起，有人唱歌，有人沉默。一面「湖南青年战地服务团」的旗帜在风中飘动。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s1_npc"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s1_npc",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "团员甲",
          "figure": { "id": "service_npc_a", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（兴奋）听说我们要去西安！胡宗南的部队！",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s1_npc1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s1_npc1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "团员乙",
          "figure": { "id": "service_npc_b", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（担忧）不知道前线什么样……你怕不怕？",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s1_npc2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s1_npc2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "带队军官",
          "figure": { "id": "recruit_officer", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（严肃）都检查好自己的行李！马上上车！",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s1_monologue_setup"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s1_monologue_setup",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "你提着简单的行李，随着队伍向绿皮火车走去。\n背后，是长沙临时大学，是熟悉的同学与师长们，是安稳的学生时光；\n前方，是未知的西北，是陌生的青年战地服务团，是漫长的潜伏之路。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s1_monologue_choice"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s1_monologue_choice",
          "type": "choice",
          "content": "登车前最后一刻，你的内心独白是——",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "「为了这片土地，我愿走入黑暗。」",
              "effects": [{ "stat": "conviction", "change": 3 }],
              "nextNodeId": "ch4s1_choose_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "「希望还能活着回来……」",
              "effects": [{ "stat": "conviction", "change": 1 }],
              "nextNodeId": "ch4s1_choose_b"
            },
            {
              "text": "「总有一天，我会光明正大地回来。」",
              "effects": [{ "stat": "conviction", "change": 2 }],
              "nextNodeId": "ch4s1_choose_c"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s1_choose_a",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "你在心里默念：为了这片土地，我愿走入黑暗。潜伏意志如铁。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s1_depart"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s1_choose_b",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "你承认自己也有恐惧——希望还能活着回来。你把这份恐惧压在心底。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s1_depart"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s1_choose_c",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "你望着远去的长沙城，暗自立誓：总有一天，我会光明正大地回来。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s1_depart"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s1_depart",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "火车缓缓启动，驶向北方。\n【系统字幕：列车穿越湖南平原，向武昌方向驶去。】",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_open"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ch4_s2_train",
      "bgLabel": "scene4_train_inside",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_open",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "【列车上·次日】\n地点：长沙开往武昌的火车上。车厢颠簸，窗外是掠过的田野。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_li_open"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_li_open",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "车厢一角，李芳兰走近你。她是服务团团长，湘雅医院护士出身，精明干练——你隐约觉得，她与国民党特务系统有些关联。\n她声音压得很低，像是随口聊天。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_li1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_li1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "李芳兰",
          "figure": { "id": "li_fanglan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "服务团有几个CP？",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_react"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_react",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "你心中一惊，面上却不动声色。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_choice"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_choice",
          "type": "choice",
          "content": "你如何应对李芳兰的试探？",
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "反问她：「去第一军的服务团会有共产党？」",
              "effects": [],
              "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_opt_a"
            },
            {
              "text": "「你弄错了。我是民先队员，公开的抗日团体。」",
              "effects": [{ "stat": "suspicion", "change": 3 }],
              "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_opt_b"
            },
            {
              "text": "沉默不答，扭头望向窗外，转移话题。",
              "effects": [{ "stat": "suspicion", "change": 5 }],
              "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_opt_c"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_opt_a",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "你",
          "figure": { "id": "player", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（镇定地反问）去第一军的服务团会有共产党？",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_opt_a_setup"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_opt_a_setup",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "李芳兰愣了一下，随即压低声音——",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_opt_a1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_opt_a1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "李芳兰",
          "figure": { "id": "li_fanglan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（愣了一下，随即压低声音）你不要瞒我。我和郭见恩是老相识。昨晚我和她谈了大半夜，她让我找你。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_opt_a2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_opt_a2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "你",
          "figure": { "id": "player", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（断然道）你要参加共产党，来找我？我马上告诉陈指导员，请他查清楚。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_opt_a3"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_opt_a3",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "李芳兰",
          "figure": { "id": "li_fanglan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（慌了）不要！千万不要！",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s2_opt_a4"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_opt_a4",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "你望着她离去的背影，手心里全是汗。你知道，她并没有完全相信你。但至少这一关，你过了。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_open"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_opt_b",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "【暴露痕迹】\n你拿公开合法的民先队员身份做挡箭牌。李芳兰依旧半信半疑，把你的名字默默记下。她没有追问，但你知道她不会轻易放过。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_open"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s2_opt_c",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "【刻意回避·疑心加重】\n你扭头望向窗外，避开这个话题。李芳兰看出你在刻意回避，目光在你脸上停留了很久。她没有再说什么，但你感觉背上多了一双眼睛。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_open"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ch4_s3_hu",
      "bgLabel": "scene4_nightroom",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_open",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "【1938年1月8日前后·武昌小朝街湖滨】\n第1军办事处二楼上。\n服务团分批接见胡宗南。你被安排在第二批。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_hu_arrive"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_hu_arrive",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "侍从副官唐西园引你们进入会客室，按名册顺序坐好。胡宗南走进来——五短身材，目光锐利，带中将领章。\n他手执名册，依次点名，问每人「为什么到本军来」，在名册上画圈——大多数画一个，少数画两个，至多三个。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_hu_turn"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_hu_turn",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "轮到你了。胡宗南瞪眼看你。周围空气一凝。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_hu_turn1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_hu_turn1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "胡宗南",
          "figure": { "id": "hu_zongnan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "洪同",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_hu_turn2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_hu_turn2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "你",
          "figure": { "id": "player", "position": "center" },
          "content": "(你没有按惯例起立，只举起右手)我就是。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_hu_turn3"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_hu_turn3",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "胡宗南瞪眼看你。周围空气一凝。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_hu_q1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_hu_q1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "胡宗南",
          "figure": { "id": "hu_zongnan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "贵庚？",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_age"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_age",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "你",
          "figure": { "id": "player", "position": "center" },
          "content": "再过三个月零四天，满十九周岁。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_age1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_age1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "胡宗南",
          "figure": { "id": "hu_zongnan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "为什么到本军来？",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_age2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_age2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "你",
          "figure": { "id": "player", "position": "center" },
          "content": "参加革命。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_hu_surprise"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_hu_surprise",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "胡宗南",
          "figure": { "id": "hu_zongnan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（一怔）先生来本军是为了参加革命？",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_revolution"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_revolution",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "你",
          "figure": { "id": "player", "position": "center" },
          "content": "(不卑不亢)孙中山先生遗嘱第一句——『余致力国民革命凡四十年』。贵军是国民革命军第1军，到贵军来，当然是参加革命。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_revolution1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_revolution1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "胡宗南",
          "figure": { "id": "hu_zongnan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（似笑非笑）怎样才是革命？",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_revolution2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_revolution2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "你",
          "figure": { "id": "player", "position": "center" },
          "content": "中山先生最初提出『驱逐鞑虏，恢复中华』。现在，『驱逐鞑虏』就是抗日。抗日就是革命。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_revolution3"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_revolution3",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "胡宗南",
          "figure": { "id": "hu_zongnan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "不愿抗日、反对抗日的算什么？",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_revolution4"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_revolution4",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "你",
          "figure": { "id": "player", "position": "center" },
          "content": "中山先生最初积极抗日的是真革命，消极抗日的是假革命，不愿抗日的是不革命，反对抗日的是反革命。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_hu_fast"
        },

        {
          "id": "ch4s3_hu_fast",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "胡宗南",
          "figure": { "id": "hu_zongnan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（突然加快语气）对反革命怎么办？",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_kill"
        },
        
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_kill",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "你",
          "figure": { "id": "player", "position": "center" },
          "content": "(脱口而出)杀。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_kill1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_kill1",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "【胡宗南盯着你看了很久。然后，他低头，在你的名字旁画了——四个圈。】",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_kill2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_kill2",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "【当天傍晚，唐西园来接你。】",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_player_kill3"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_player_kill3",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "唐西园",
          "figure": { "id": "tang_xiyuan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "胡先生约你去个别谈话。今天画了四个圈的，只有你一个。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_private"
        },

        {
          "id": "ch4s3_private_setup",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "【个别谈话】\n胡宗南详细询问你的家庭背景、读书经历、对北平「学潮」的看法、对共产党的认识等。你一一应对，态度不卑不亢。谈话结束后，胡宗南与你握手。末了说了一句：",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_private_hu1"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_private_hu1",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "胡宗南",
          "figure": { "id": "hu_zongnan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "明天中午，我派唐副官坐车去府上，专程请令尊来便餐。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_private_setup2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_private_setup2",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "你刚走出门口，胡宗南又叫住你：",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_private_hu2"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_private_hu2",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "胡宗南",
          "figure": { "id": "hu_zongnan", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（叫住你）你那句话——『对反革命怎么办？杀。』——说得痛快。但是记住了，在战场上，只有枪能回答这个问题。笔杆子再硬，也硬不过子弹。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_private_player"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_private_player",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "你",
          "figure": { "id": "player", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（站定转身）学生记住了。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s3_private_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s3_private_end",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "【解锁永久状态：四圈之才——胡宗南初见即破格赏识】",
          "effects": [{ "stat": "conviction", "change": 3 }],
          "inventoryChanges": { "add": ["status_four_circles"] },
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s4_open"
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "ch4_s4_baban",
      "bgLabel": "scene4_room",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ch4s4_open",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "【1938年1月上旬某夜·汉口旧日租界89号】\n八路军驻武汉办事处。\n你带上池际尚、许焕国（服务团内的秘密党员），乘渡轮过江来到汉口。值班人员说蒋南翔不在，由董必武接见。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s4_dong_meet"
        }]},
    {
      "id": "ch4_s4_dong",
      "bgLabel": "scene4_nightroom",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "ch4s4_dong_meet",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "董必武",
          "figure": { "id": "dong_biwu", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（52岁，头发花白，目光如炬，声音沉稳。让池际尚、许焕国在楼下等，单独将你叫上楼。示意你坐下，打量你片刻）你的情况，南翔汇报过了。胡宗南接见你时，表现如何？",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s4_report"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s4_report_setup",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "你汇报了胡宗南面试的经过——四个圈、个别谈话、那句名言。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s4_report_dong"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s4_report_dong",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "董必武",
          "figure": { "id": "dong_biwu", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（露出满意的神色）这基本符合恩来同志的预想。他说，谈一次，要管几年。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s4_report_end"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s4_report_end",
          "type": "narration",
          "content": "董必武从抽屉里取出一封信，不是递给你，只是展开给你看——周恩来写给胡宗南的亲笔信，信上说「兄以剿共成名，私心则以兄尚未成民族英雄为憾」。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s4_dong_letter"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s4_dong_letter",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "董必武",
          "figure": { "id": "dong_biwu", "position": "center" },
          "content": "（收起信，语气郑重）恩来说，这叫『布闲棋，下冷子』。国共合作共同抗日，是现阶段的大局。但蒋介石、胡宗南在抗战中会不会反共？还难以断言。所以我们未雨绸缪，先走一步。\n你的任务，不是到胡宗南那里混口饭吃。你是去当一颗『闲棋冷子』——如果一直闲着冷着，于大局无损；如果不闲不冷，于大局有利。",
          "nextNodeId": "ch4s4_dong_three"
        },
        {
          "id": "ch4s4_dong_three",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "董必武",
